<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Nov non-EU exports 695.8 mln punts - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish Nov non-EU exports 695.8 mln punts - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's exports to countries outside the European Union fell to a seasonally adjusted 695.8 million Irish pounds in November from 781.9 million in October, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Imports from non-EU countries fell to a seasonally adjusted 680.0 million punts from 693.2 million in October, the CSO said.</p>
<p>--Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
